    "body": "Closes #47.\n\nDocuments the decision to keep README in English while keeping CONTRIBUTING and docs in Arabic.\n\n## Context\n- ADR-002 set the general policy: Arabic for documentation.\n- PR #42 translated README to Arabic, but GitHub does not render RTL correctly.\n- PR #44 tried a div dir=rtl workaround, which did not work.\n- PR #46 reverted README to English.\n\n## What this ADR does\n- Records the language decision per file type.\n- Supplements ADR-002 without modifying it (per ADR convention).\n- Notes that a future README.ar.md file may be added later.",
    "closed_at": "2026-09-22T09:33:08Z",
